&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 8px"&gt;（第８期）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 1.33px"&gt;
